<div style="font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 14px; color: #1f2937; line-height: 1.6; max-width: 600px;">
  <p>Hi <strong>{{ greeting_name or "Team" }}</strong>,</p>

  <p>I'm <strong>{{ sender.first_name }}</strong> from <strong>{{ sender.company }}</strong>.</p>

  <p>I came across your business and wanted to reach out as we work with businesses in the <strong>pest control industry</strong> across website development, SEO, AEO/GEO, paid marketing, and overall digital growth.</p>

  <p>We recently designed and developed the website for <strong>Pest Stop Control</strong>, a UK-based pest control business, and continue to support them with their digital marketing and growth:<br>
  <a href="https://www.peststopcontrol.com/" style="color:#2563eb;">https://www.peststopcontrol.com/</a></p>

  <p>Based on this experience, we'd love to explore how we could support your business as well &mdash; from improving your website and local search visibility to generating more qualified enquiries through organic and paid channels.</p>
  {%- if ai_hook %}

  <p>{{ ai_hook }}</p>
  {%- endif %}

  <p>We can also review your current website and share a few opportunities specific to your business.</p>

  <p>Would you be open to a brief conversation?</p>

  <p>Best regards,</p>

  <table cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" role="presentation" style="margin: 8px 0 24px;">
    <tr>
      <td style="padding-right: 18px; vertical-align: top;">
        <img src="cid:webify_logo_signature" width="88" alt="{{ sender.company }}" style="display: block; width: 88px;">
      </td>
      <td style="border-left: 3px solid #1e2a4a; padding-left: 18px; vertical-align: top;">
        <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: .02em; color: #111827; text-transform: uppercase;">{{ sender.first_name }} {{ sender.last_name }}</div>
        <div style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; color: #111827; margin-top: 2px;">{{ sender.designation }} - {{ sender.company }}</div>
        <div style="font-size: 13px; color: #374151; margin-top: 6px;">
          &#9993;&#65039; <a href="mailto:{{ sender.signature_email or sender.email }}" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">{{ sender.signature_email or sender.email }}</a>
          &nbsp;|&nbsp;
          &#128222; {{ sender.phone }}
        </div>

        <!-- Horizontal rule echoing the vertical one beside the logo. -->
        <div style="border-top: 2px solid #1e2a4a; margin: 12px 0 10px; width: 340px; max-width: 100%;"></div>

        <div style="font-size: 13px;">
          {%- if sender.linkedin_url %}
          <a href="{{ sender.linkedin_url }}" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">LinkedIn</a>
          &nbsp;|&nbsp;
          {%- endif %}
          <a href="{{ sender.website }}" style="color: #2563eb; text-decoration: underline;">{{ sender.company }}</a>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 8px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700;">
          <a href="https://www.peststopcontrol.com/" style="color: #1e2a4a; text-decoration: none;">Recent work: Pest Stop Control</a>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 2px; font-size: 12px; color: #6b7280; max-width: 430px;">Website design and development, plus ongoing SEO and digital marketing for a UK pest control business.</div>
      </td>
    </tr>
  </table>

  <p style="font-size: 12px; color: #374151; margin-top: 4px;">
    ** If this is not relevant or you'd prefer not to hear from us again, simply reply <strong>&quot;Opt Out&quot;</strong> and we'll remove you from future communication. We respect your privacy and do not share your information. **
  </p>
</div>
